# Demo: lx ai:migration
# Record with: vhs ai-migration.tape
# Requires ANTHROPIC_API_KEY to be set

Output demos/ai-migration.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 480
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Shell "bash"

Type `lx ai:migration "orders table with user_id, items as JSON, total decimal, status, nullable paid_at"`
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
